      <title>Omdia 报告：苹果搁置16.1至18英寸大型可折叠MacBook开发</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260903/Omdia-%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C%E6%90%81%E7%BD%AE16.1%E8%87%B318%E8%8B%B1%E5%AF%B8%E5%A4%A7%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%AF%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0MacBook%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91/</link>
